# Sensitive Bridge v1.4 Framework Composition

## Ownership

The framework menu is clinician-set per client. The AI selects a per-turn lens from the enabled set and records the selected lenses in audit only.

## Composition

Prompt composition is capped at 2 lenses:

1. Primary lens supplies the full framework directive.
2. Secondary lens supplies one supplementary sentence.
3. Lenses 3+ are audit-only and excluded from the prompt.

## Client Surface

Do not surface lens labels to clients. Use them for response shaping and `sensitive_bridge_log.framework_lens_selected`.

## Crystal Graph

`crystal_knowledge_graph_enabled` defaults to false. Layer 3 graph traversal is Phase G only.
